{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>34歲十優港姐麥明詩昨日撇下歲半兒子與老公盛勁為盛裝赴宴，極度性感打扮瞬間成為全場焦點。產後極速修身罕有以極具視覺衝擊力造型示人，惹火程度辣㷫全網。盛勁為面對妻子大解放更按捺不住情緒，隨即在網上以兩字強勢宣示主權。</p>\n<h2>麥明詩穿銀灰色亮片晚裝惹火現身</h2>\n<p>麥明詩昨日（22日）在社交平台分享兩張赴宴照片並簡單寫上「About last night 💃」，相中身穿一件銀灰色亮片繞頸晚裝展現傲人身段。這套晚裝胸前採用中門大開超性感剪裁並一路延伸至腹部，完美展現出產後升級豐滿上圍。極具視覺衝擊力大膽設計令曲線若隱若現，散發出高貴惹火女人味。</p>\n<h2>盛勁為見狀火速留兩字高調護妻</h2>\n<p>面對妻子如此性感火辣打扮，盛勁為第一時間在靚相下留言寫上「辣媽」兩個字，字裡行間滿是寵愛與自豪。這句甜到漏讚賞隨即引發大批粉絲起哄，就連同為港姐出身好姊妹朱千雪亦忍不住現身留言大讚「Pretty !」，盡顯兩人相交多年深厚閨密情誼。</p>\n<h2>轉戰商界出任傳承教育非執行董事</h2>\n<p>麥明詩與丈夫於2025年3月誕下愛子，兒子現時約1歲8個月大。擁有劍橋大學法律系學歷及紐約律師資格近年成功從幕前轉型進軍商界及教育界，先是加入全球頂尖管理顧問公司麥肯錫擔任商業顧問，其後又出任上市公司傳承教育非執行董事。</p>\n<h2>大批網民起哄催促兩人盡快追二胎</h2>\n<p>震撼視覺照片一出隨即引來大批網民派Like，眾人紛紛驚呼「靚到發光」以及盛讚是「最美港姐」。看到盛勁為高調讚美後，網民更瘋狂打趣回覆盛勁為「好快生多個！」，催促兩人趕緊再接再厲為兒子增添弟妹，並大讚麥明詩是智慧與美貌並重。<br/>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179540517647068043_10625745466b03b5791850a.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"louisa_mak_1795324881_4035799789064326691_1199813793.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179540517647068043_10625745466b03b5791850a.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@louisa_mak）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179540518026795603_14656125946b03b57cab3a8.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179540518026795603_14656125946b03b57cab3a8.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@louisa_mak）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/177492483545452881_23620563069cb3423963ba.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"麥明詩 港姐 （圖片來源：IG@louisa_mak）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/177492483545452881_23620563069cb3423963ba.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@louisa_mak）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179540518300817523_9442662076b03b57f6ce15.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"louisa_mak_1795324881_4035799796681196023_1199813793.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179540518300817523_9442662076b03b57f6ce15.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@louisa_mak）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179540518581588547_19899917136b03b58242b68.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"香港小姐 麥明詩15年香港小姐冠軍﹗（圖片來源：新傳媒圖片）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179540518581588547_19899917136b03b58242b68.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>麥明詩15年香港小姐冠軍﹗（圖片來源：新傳媒圖片）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/06/photo_2025-06-24_14-49-56-2_1783113275685a4b5a37249-1024x1271.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"香港小姐 麥明詩（Louisa）由初輪面試開始已經成為傳媒關注點。（圖片來源：東方新地）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/06/photo_2025-06-24_14-49-56-2_1783113275685a4b5a37249-1024x1271.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>麥明詩（Louisa）由初輪面試開始已經成為傳媒關注點。（圖片來源：東方新地）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T03:49:26.557497+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1016,"images":6,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T03:39:51+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T04:03:04.270904+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T03:42:51.269536+00:00","content_hash":"8228a3ce94c6339ed37f42d5b64d67bf55bdf503c118c05ca7d85d0fe9777afb","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}